        "depth": 1,
        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "Four-lane ARM64 SIMD can shorten the polynomial hash dependency chain while preserving every hash value and the exact search behavior.",
        "id": "b06904da8f224578",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
        "role": "B",
        "source_commits": [],
        "sources": [],
        "transformations": {
          "files": [
            "src/sokoban.c"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Factor the K&R hash into four independent NEON recurrences using base 31^4, then recombine with weights 31^3, 31^2, 31 and 1.",
            "Retain scalar processing for tails, short vectors and non-NEON builds; make the hash helper static inline."
          ]
        },
